/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 732 Tm () Tj
/F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 718 Tm (Exercise 1: Inspecting Modbus TCP Telemetry & Staged Study References) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 702 Tm (Standard Modbus TCP lacks session authentication and encryption. Any host on the same) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 689 Tm (network segment \(`mednet`\) can query holding registers to inspect device parameters) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 676 Tm (and read the ASCII-encoded path of the active X-ray radiograph stored in `HR 5..20`.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 663 Tm () Tj
