/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 636 Tm () Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 622 Tm (```bash) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 609 Tm (docker exec -it protocol-audit-client python audit_inspector.py) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 596 Tm (```) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 583 Tm () Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 569 Tm (What to Observe:) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 556 Tm (- The script connects to `xray-modbus-controller:5020` using `pymodbus` Function Code) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 543 Tm (`03` \(Read Holding Registers\) and Function Code `01` \(Read Coils\).) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 530 Tm (- `hr_5_20_staged_image_path` reveals the exact URI path on the image server \(such as) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 517 Tm (`/images/XR-HUMYN-001.png`\) corresponding to `hr_3_selected_study_index`.) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 504 Tm (- Simultaneously, check the Controller & Access Audit Log table in the Web GUI) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 491 Tm (\(`http://localhost:8080`\) to see how requests are logged.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 478 Tm () Tj
/F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 464 Tm (Exercise 2: Analyzing Controller-to-PACS Trust Boundaries) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 448 Tm (Review how the controller synchronizes state with the Image Server in [`xray-) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 435 Tm (controller/controller.py`]\(xray-controller/controller.py\):) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 422 Tm (1. Every 1.5 seconds, the controller reads `HR 1` \(`TubeKvp`\), `HR 2` \(`TubeMas`\), `HR) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 409 Tm (3` \(`SelectedStudyIdx`\), and `Coil 1` \(`ExposureTrigger`\).) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 396 Tm (2. It sends a JSON payload to `POST http://medical-image-server:8080/api/plc-sync`.) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 383 Tm (3. In the default baseline configuration \(`REQUIRE_PLC_TOKEN=false` and) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 370 Tm (`PLC_READ_ONLY_LOCK=false`\), neither the Modbus registers nor the HTTP synchronization) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 357 Tm (endpoint enforce authentication or write protection.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 344 Tm () Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 330 Tm (Discussion Questions for Students:) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 317 Tm (- Why is placing a Modbus TCP controller on the same flat subnet as a PACS image) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 304 Tm (archive dangerous in a hospital network?) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 291 Tm (- If an unauthorized device modifies `HR 1` \(`TubeKvp`\), `HR 2` \(`TubeMas`\), or `Coil) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 278 Tm (0` \(`DoorInterlock`\), what are the clinical and patient-safety implications?) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 265 Tm (- How does encoding file paths or study identifiers inside world-readable PLC) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 252 Tm (registers \(`HR 5..20`\) create an information disclosure risk?) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 239 Tm () Tj
